---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure — OnlineCheckPrinter"
  description="How OnlineCheckPrinter.com makes money and how affiliate links affect our reviews."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6">Affiliate Disclosure</h1>

    <div class="prose-article">
      <p>
        In accordance with the U.S. Federal Trade Commission's 16 CFR Part 255 (the FTC
        Endorsement Guides), OnlineCheckPrinter.com discloses the following:
      </p>

      <h2>Affiliate relationships</h2>

      <p>
        Some links on this site are affiliate links. This means that if you click one of those
        links and subsequently sign up for, purchase, or apply for a product or service, we may
        receive a commission from the merchant at <strong>no additional cost to you</strong>.
      </p>

      <p>
        These commissions support the operation of this site and allow us to continue
        publishing independent research on check-printing services and software.
      </p>

      <h2>How commissions affect our reviews</h2>

      <p>
        Our editorial team ranks products based on merit — price transparency, security
        features, integration quality, and overall value to a small business owner. We do
        <strong>not</strong> let commission rates determine our rankings. If a product is bad,
        we will say so even if it has a generous affiliate program. If a product is good, we
        will recommend it even if we earn nothing from doing so.
      </p>

      <h2>Not financial or legal advice</h2>

      <p>
        Content on this site is for informational purposes only and does not constitute
        financial, tax, legal, or accounting advice. Always consult a qualified professional
        before making decisions about your business finances.
      </p>

      <h2>Questions?</h2>

      <p>
        If you have questions about our disclosures or editorial process, email us at
        <a href="mailto:hello@onlinecheckprinter.com">hello@onlinecheckprinter.com</a>.
      </p>

      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-10">
        Last updated: August 2026.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
